# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): chord changes on the Live page at Snap 0 (a wash, a slow glide), 50
# (legato, a short glide) and 100 (a pad's attack, the reverb's and delay's tails cut).
# Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
wait 600
wav chord-snap.wav
turn ALGO -10
tapkey 7
wait 4000
tapkey 13
tapkey 4
wait 4000
turn ALGO 10
tapkey 22
tapkey 0
wait 4000
tapkey 20
tapkey 2
wait 4000
turn ALGO 10
tapkey 7
wait 4000
tapkey 13
tapkey 4
wait 4000
wavstop
